          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "পরিবেশন (pôribeshôn) is a tatsama, Sanskrit pariveṣaṇa, \"waiting at table, serving up a meal\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
